  "tagline": "CNCF sandbox distributed time-series database from Huawei Cloud, compatible with InfluxQL.",
  "description": "openGemini is a distributed time-series database open-sourced by Huawei Cloud in 2022 and now a CNCF sandbox project. It speaks the InfluxDB 1.x line protocol and InfluxQL, so Telegraf, Grafana and Influx clients work unchanged, while adding a shared-nothing cluster, columnar storage for high-cardinality data and Prometheus remote write. It targets operators who need InfluxDB 1.x compatibility at scale without InfluxDB Enterprise. Releases slowed in 2026, with release candidates but no stable release since January, so check activity before committing.",
